1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,220
Hello there!

2
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:06,600
Good morning, Boxo! Hello there!

3
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,409
Hey, good morning, Lammis!

4
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:10,733
Karyos, Gorth, morning!

5
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:12,897
Thanks for keeping watch again today!

6
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:13,810
Sure!

7
00:00:13,893 --> 00:00:16,777
Nothing beats a sweet tea
at the end of a night shift!

8
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,978
I look forward to serving you again!

9
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:23,702
Welp, I died and was reborn
as a venting machine.

10
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:26,840
A pretty bizarre situation
to find oneself in.

11
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:32,171
Despite the weirdness of it all, I've
still found ways to enjoy my new life.

12
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:43,657
On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,
but inside, I've still got a human soul.

13
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:44,917
In this new world of wonders,

14
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,917
I travel to and fro on the back
of my super strong partner,

15
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:48,830
Lamas.

16
00:00:48,913 --> 00:00:50,920
The name's Boxo. Hello there!

17
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:52,900
That means yes, by the way.

18
00:02:09,380 --> 00:02:12,060
Wow, summer already! Hello there!

19
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:15,640
Yeah, I'm sure does fly, huh? Oh, right.

20
00:02:15,920 --> 00:02:20,037
There's a sky here with changing weather,
and the seasons change too, like on Earth.

21
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:23,179
So I forget we're in a
dungeon with multiple strata.

22
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:27,400
Once it really heats up, I'll
start selling ice cream! Boxo!

23
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:29,220
Oh, hey there, Mishuel.

24
00:02:29,340 --> 00:02:31,697
I stand before you with a humble request.

25
00:02:31,780 --> 00:02:33,537
By your face, it seems serious.

26
00:02:33,620 --> 00:02:34,897
Yes, it is quite serious.

27
00:02:34,980 --> 00:02:36,637
I have given it careful consideration.

28
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:40,220
Dear Boxo, your steel body
houses a kind and noble heart.

29
00:02:40,420 --> 00:02:42,897
Your defense is top tier and
you can even raise the dead.

30
00:02:42,980 --> 00:02:46,757
You are a magical item, but nonetheless,
I am totally enamored with you.

31
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:48,820
Did he say enamored?

32
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:53,237
And so, Boxo, I ask that as of today,
you grant me leave to call you master.

33
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:56,144
You mean enamored in like
a platonic way, right?

34
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,020
Is that a no?

35
00:02:58,340 --> 00:03:00,617
Michelle is an expert hunter, no question.

36
00:03:00,700 --> 00:03:02,288
But his social skills suck.

37
00:03:02,660 --> 00:03:05,237
Still, that confession took
a whole lot of courage.

38
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:08,100
I gotta be mature about this. Hello there!

39
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:10,680
So that means you accept?

40
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,237
Oh, thank you, Master Boxo!

41
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,337
You won't regret it!

42
00:03:13,420 --> 00:03:15,877
Um, we're just hugging his friends, right?

43
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:17,280
Right? Just friends?

44
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:21,897
Somebody's got themselves
an apprentice now.

45
00:03:21,980 --> 00:03:22,977
Congrats, Boxo.

46
00:03:23,060 --> 00:03:23,890
Big milestone.

47
00:03:23,973 --> 00:03:24,997
Now wait just a minute!

48
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:26,317
I've got nothing to teach an apprentice!

49
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:27,280
What do I do?

50
00:03:27,620 --> 00:03:30,197
All right, then, Master
Boxo, first things first.

51
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,986
It is time for a sponge bath.

52
00:03:32,140 --> 00:03:36,137
Well, Boxo's sponge baths are my
responsibility, so you don't need to bother.

53
00:03:36,220 --> 00:03:37,080
Oh, I see.

54
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:39,317
I didn't mean to step on your toes.

55
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,230
My apologies.

56
00:03:40,920 --> 00:03:41,780
Ah, excellent.

57
00:03:42,060 --> 00:03:43,817
I'm glad to find you all here.

58
00:03:43,900 --> 00:03:45,018
Hey, Director Bear.

59
00:03:45,380 --> 00:03:50,117
Boxo, Lamas, Hulamine, Mishra, We're
gearing up to hold a very important meeting.

60
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:51,717
in the Dead's Lament Stratum.

61
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:53,976
I'd love for you all to accompany me.

62
00:04:03,420 --> 00:04:06,197
These humans, along with
the magical item Boxo,

63
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:09,177
are the survivors of a harrowing
encounter with the Netherlord.

64
00:04:09,260 --> 00:04:11,436
The famous magical merchant box, huh?

65
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:14,837
The one that sells unusual items
at fair prices without the hassle?

66
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:15,750
Indeed.

67
00:04:15,833 --> 00:04:17,817
Not to mention his useful
abilities that have

68
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:20,606
saved us from certain
death on many occasions.

69
00:04:21,140 --> 00:04:22,500
He wasn't kidding.

70
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:26,937
This must be important if the directors
of each stratum's hunters association are

71
00:04:27,020 --> 00:04:31,557
here Let's cut right to the chase the fell
netherlord who appeared a few days ago.

72
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:34,993
He is the demon Lord's left-armed
general I'm sure of it.

73
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:39,437
That spells big trouble the
netherlord that mysterious.

74
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:42,517
Fore-armed skeleton who made
a surprise appearance and an

75
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:46,247
unwelcome one when we defeated
the dead's lament stratum lord?

76
00:04:46,460 --> 00:04:49,401
He stopped Hulamis and
Shuey's hearts using magic.

77
00:04:49,540 --> 00:04:51,640
Luckily, I transformed into an AED,

78
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:55,340
and my electroshocks
successfully resuscitated them.

79
00:04:55,640 --> 00:05:00,400
It's a miracle that nobody died, but we
can't let a bad dude like him run free.

80
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:04,540
That's Kerioyl, the leader
of the Menagerie of Fools.

81
00:05:04,980 --> 00:05:08,509
I can't see his face, but he
seems more menacing than usual.

82
00:05:08,820 --> 00:05:09,650
Question.

83
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:12,193
Sorry, but what is a left-armed general?

84
00:05:12,540 --> 00:05:15,237
Far to the north, beyond
the reaches of this dungeon,

85
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:18,000
There lies a land ruled by the Demon Lord.

86
00:05:18,140 --> 00:05:19,357
There's a Demon Lord?

87
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:23,057
Wait, I guess it would be kind of weird
not to have one in a world like this.

88
00:05:23,140 --> 00:05:25,557
If you think of the Demon
Lord himself as the head,

89
00:05:25,640 --> 00:05:27,557
then rank the others in descending order.

90
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:31,297
Right arm, left arm, then the right
leg, and the left leg as last.

91
00:05:31,380 --> 00:05:36,037
So the left arm general would be the number
three rank in the Demon Lord's forces.

92
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:37,708
The number three rank, huh?

93
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:40,600
Why would a leader be
in a place like that?

94
00:05:40,900 --> 00:05:43,217
The Demon Lord's forces
are never good news.

95
00:05:43,300 --> 00:05:45,717
It seems unlikely that
they would invade us.

96
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:49,237
They would have to make it past
empires and fortified cities.

97
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,640
So, what do we do?

98
00:05:50,860 --> 00:05:55,337
He attacked association members inside the
dungeon and our collective watch to boot.

99
00:05:55,420 --> 00:05:59,117
That means we hit him with everything
we've got and show no mercy!

100
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:01,617
Whoa, you don't get this
riled up very often.

101
00:06:01,700 --> 00:06:04,197
Letting him get away with this
would be bad for business.

102
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:06,917
And we've got some skilled
hunters who will help out.

103
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:09,397
The Origin Stratum will
provide some as well.

104
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:13,217
With what that bag of bones put my people
through, he's in for some serious payback.

105
00:06:13,300 --> 00:06:15,417
I shall fight alongside you as well.

106
00:06:15,500 --> 00:06:17,441
I, too, wish to settle the score.

107
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,040
You've got my fist, too.

108
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:23,817
After what he did to Hulemy and Shui, I
won't rest until I suck him real good.

109
00:06:23,900 --> 00:06:26,200
That right, Boxo? Hello there.

110
00:06:27,300 --> 00:06:30,457
And Hulemy, you can help us
figure out the plan of attack.

111
00:06:30,540 --> 00:06:33,997
I'll help with planning, but
that bony jerk tried to kill me.

112
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:36,217
I can't wait to pay him back in person.

113
00:06:36,300 --> 00:06:37,520
I like your style.

114
00:06:39,540 --> 00:06:41,677
I appreciate all the enthusiasm.

115
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:45,457
The Clearblow-Legged Stratum will put
nothing but our best on this mission.

116
00:06:45,540 --> 00:06:50,240
Let us all work together to bring down
the Netherlord once and for all! Yeah!

117
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:53,737
It's times like these
when I can't help but

118
00:06:53,820 --> 00:06:56,349
miss having fists to
raise with my friends.

119
00:06:56,920 --> 00:07:01,744
It wasn't long before the Aces from each
Stratum showed up to enlist in our cause.

120
00:07:04,580 --> 00:07:06,980
Hi, Llamas, Hulemy, Boxo.

121
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:09,377
You two are in the Assault Squad?

122
00:07:09,460 --> 00:07:10,290
Of course.

123
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:13,000
Hello there, Boxo.

124
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:16,937
Been wondering where my favorite
sentient snack dispenser went.

125
00:07:17,020 --> 00:07:19,917
Let's see, I'll take the
usual Miss soup and a water.

126
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:20,830
I feel it.

127
00:07:20,913 --> 00:07:23,517
Today's the day I get
lucky with those numbers.

128
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:25,277
The gate guards are one thing.

129
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:29,831
But why is the elderly couple I see
every morning part of the assault squad?

130
00:07:31,580 --> 00:07:32,640
Hello, Boxo.

131
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:33,860
You too, llamas.

132
00:07:34,020 --> 00:07:35,020
Oh, hi, director.

133
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:38,237
I heard you were there
when Shui needed you.

134
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:39,197
I'm so grateful.

135
00:07:39,280 --> 00:07:42,000
Hoxie runs an orphanage
in the Origin Stratum.

136
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:45,060
I'm pretty sure she
taught Shui archery, too.

137
00:07:45,980 --> 00:07:46,820
Hello, Hoxie.

138
00:07:46,980 --> 00:07:48,717
Will you be joining us
on this mission, too?

139
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,682
Has life been treating you well?

140
00:07:50,860 --> 00:07:52,154
Shimelai, Yumite.

141
00:07:52,300 --> 00:07:53,660
Yes, I am, and it has.

142
00:07:54,060 --> 00:07:55,620
They all know each other?

143
00:07:55,880 --> 00:07:59,115
Well then, maybe I've
underestimated all three of them.

144
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:03,520
That day, ace hunters from each
stratum came rushing to our aid.

145
00:08:03,780 --> 00:08:07,037
And we held a kickoff party before
setting out after the Netherlord.

146
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:09,440
So many different types of people.

147
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:14,357
That's right, and I bet every one of them
possesses some kind of powerful blessing.

148
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:16,957
What's with all the
old fogies around here?

149
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,577
This ain't no nursing home.

150
00:08:18,660 --> 00:08:20,337
You geezers sure you're up to snuff?

151
00:08:20,420 --> 00:08:21,357
Watch your mouth.

152
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:23,977
You know what happens to people
with no manners around here?

153
00:08:24,060 --> 00:08:24,890
Nothing good.

154
00:08:25,020 --> 00:08:26,017
What did you say?

155
00:08:26,100 --> 00:08:28,417
Because it sounds like you're
trying to start something.

156
00:08:28,500 --> 00:08:29,517
Do you know who we are?

157
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:31,080
Uh-oh. Hello there.

158
00:08:31,740 --> 00:08:32,570
What's up?

159
00:08:32,653 --> 00:08:33,597
Someone getting mouthy?

160
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:36,477
Hey, Lamas, give this guy a
little thump and knock him out.

161
00:08:36,560 --> 00:08:37,620
Wait a sec.

162
00:08:37,800 --> 00:08:39,917
Are you telling me you're with these guys?

163
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,320
Yeah, you bet I am.

164
00:08:41,500 --> 00:08:43,037
Though I guess if you
want to get technical,

165
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:45,277
I'm still trying to get
them to join my group.

166
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:47,242
That's sweet, Captain Carry Oil.

167
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:49,580
You said Carry Oil?

168
00:08:49,740 --> 00:08:53,340
You're not Captain Carry Oil
of the Menagerie of Fools?

169
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,660
And what if I am?

170
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:56,630
Nothing!

171
00:08:56,713 --> 00:08:57,957
Nothing at all, Captain Carry Oil!

172
00:08:58,040 --> 00:08:59,216
You said that was...

173
00:09:01,880 --> 00:09:03,056
You heard it, folks.

174
00:09:03,220 --> 00:09:05,277
I'm the leader of the Menagerie of Fools.

175
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,360
Name's Carry Oil.

176
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:11,157
And as my members are out of commission,
I am especially grateful for your help.

177
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:14,652
Oh, it's rare for the captain
to greet anyone so politely.

178
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:15,670
By the way,

179
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:18,357
Shui and the Red and White
Twins have yet to recover,

180
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:20,277
so they're apparently
sitting this one out.

181
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:23,125
Not that they wanted to
stay behind, of course.

182
00:09:23,700 --> 00:09:25,060
My name is Mishuel.

183
00:09:25,260 --> 00:09:26,997
I may be young and inexperienced,

184
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:30,157
but I so look forward to your
guidance and encouragement.

185
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,620
And my name is Hoxie.

186
00:09:31,740 --> 00:09:33,117
I'm here from the Origin Strand.

187
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,900
Hello there, I'm Yumitei.

188
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:39,677
My blessings are a bit of healing light
along with a whole lot of swordsmanship.

189
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:41,360
The name's Shimei Lai.

190
00:09:41,620 --> 00:09:43,697
I know magic and have several blessings.

191
00:09:43,780 --> 00:09:44,897
Ask and I'll tell ya.

192
00:09:44,980 --> 00:09:46,400
Once again, I am Karios.

193
00:09:46,860 --> 00:09:48,020
And I'm Gorth.

194
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:52,220
I'm Hulemy, a magic item engineer
and Lamas' childhood friend.

195
00:09:52,740 --> 00:09:53,960
That's me, Lamas!

196
00:09:54,140 --> 00:09:57,420
And this here is my magical
partner, Boxo. Hello there!

197
00:09:59,100 --> 00:10:02,637
Ah, a vanguard, mirror
guard, and recovery team.

198
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:04,838
That's a fairly well-balanced party,

199
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:08,257
although our older member's
strength has yet to be demonstrated.

200
00:10:08,340 --> 00:10:10,281
I have faith in Captain Kerioyl.

201
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:12,304
I know he won't lead us astray.

202
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:14,097
Nice to meet you all.

203
00:10:14,180 --> 00:10:15,757
Our search begins tomorrow.

204
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:18,680
Let's get sweet revenge
on that bonehead! Yeah!

205
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:24,800
Boxo! Boxo!

206
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:26,230
Boxo!

207
00:10:28,540 --> 00:10:29,717
The following day,

208
00:10:29,800 --> 00:10:32,077
we split into several teams and each group

209
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:33,997
headed towards their
intended search target.

210
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:37,697
I'm really sorry to saddle you
all with this dangerous task.

211
00:10:37,780 --> 00:10:40,133
You never change, do you, Director Bear?

212
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:44,162
Your leadership style is as
self-deprecating as ever That's right,

213
00:10:44,260 --> 00:10:45,737
everyone signed on willingly.

214
00:10:45,820 --> 00:10:47,702
There's nothing to apologize for

215
00:10:49,280 --> 00:10:52,104
Well, there's a sight
that brings back memories.

216
00:10:52,700 --> 00:10:55,759
Up ahead, there's a group
of monsters lying in wait!

217
00:10:56,340 --> 00:10:57,170
Hmm.

218
00:10:57,253 --> 00:11:00,137
Yumite, Hoxie, why don't the
three of us go deal with them?

219
00:11:00,220 --> 00:11:02,097
A group effort with my senior members?

220
00:11:02,180 --> 00:11:04,121
The thought has me all nostalgic.

221
00:11:04,220 --> 00:11:06,279
Oh, light and shroud my arrowheads.

222
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:11,920
I love when she shoots three at once.

223
00:11:12,160 --> 00:11:13,320
My, expertly done.

224
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:15,037
Still fighting as dirty as ever.

225
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:16,120
That's our Hoxie.

226
00:11:16,420 --> 00:11:18,000
Wow, I'm impressed.

227
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:20,697
Looks like those monsters are still so far

228
00:11:20,780 --> 00:11:22,877
away that they haven't
even noticed us yet.

229
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,901
Time to invite them to the party!

230
00:11:40,260 --> 00:11:41,580
Good show, you three.

231
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:44,057
It seems your skills are as sharp as ever.

232
00:11:44,140 --> 00:11:46,380
Nah, we're not in top form anymore.

233
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:50,377
Soon, though, guess I had better
polish up my magic skills.

234
00:11:50,460 --> 00:11:52,931
My cuts aren't as sharp as they once were.

235
00:11:53,680 --> 00:11:55,880
If only Agent could spare warriors.

236
00:11:56,260 --> 00:11:59,457
This battle is certainly not
one that I'd brag about to Shui,

237
00:11:59,540 --> 00:12:01,157
but the next one sure will be.

238
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:03,220
So modest too, Boxo.

239
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:05,297
We're gonna have to work hard to keep up.

240
00:12:05,380 --> 00:12:06,210
Hello there.

241
00:12:10,860 --> 00:12:12,640
Dang, this hits the spot.

242
00:12:13,680 --> 00:12:15,915
Shui would be so jealous if she knew.

243
00:12:16,080 --> 00:12:19,374
I'd like to try every one of
his foods on this campaign.

244
00:12:19,680 --> 00:12:24,017
If it meant eating his food for every
meal, would follow Boxxo to hell and back.

245
00:12:24,100 --> 00:12:25,140
You said it!

246
00:12:26,220 --> 00:12:30,338
Come back for as many helpings as
you want, if it'll keep morale high.

247
00:12:34,540 --> 00:12:35,600
Here's a tip.

248
00:12:36,180 --> 00:12:37,886
Lower your center of gravity.

249
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:42,297
That'll make things much easier and
it'll improve your power and accuracy.

250
00:12:42,380 --> 00:12:43,615
My center of gravity?

251
00:12:44,020 --> 00:12:45,360
Yeah, I'll try it.

252
00:12:49,740 --> 00:12:51,157
That felt much better.

253
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:52,960
And it looked better, too.

254
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:58,009
Your work should be about getting used
to fighting without Boxo on your back.

255
00:12:58,140 --> 00:12:58,970
Right!

256
00:13:00,540 --> 00:13:03,717
Blessing of Might gives Lamas
more strength than she can handle.

257
00:13:03,800 --> 00:13:06,388
She has to work hard
learning to control it.

258
00:13:06,560 --> 00:13:10,197
Usually she has me on her back, which
gives her just the right handicap.

259
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:13,692
If she could manage her strength
well enough without me...

260
00:13:16,860 --> 00:13:18,600
You can do it, Lamas!

261
00:13:27,860 --> 00:13:30,077
Hey boxo you got a minute?

262
00:13:30,160 --> 00:13:31,377
Hello there!

263
00:13:31,460 --> 00:13:36,397
This one thing's been bothering
me it makes no sense but...

264
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:38,717
I think the nether lord
let llamas go on purpose.

265
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:39,917
Heal me!

266
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:42,677
If he had wiped us out in that moment,

267
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:46,077
we wouldn't have reported back or
met with the other stratum directors

268
00:13:46,160 --> 00:13:49,317
which means this elite assault
force would never have been formed.

269
00:13:49,400 --> 00:13:53,877
In other words what if his goal
is to use himself as bait to

270
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:56,957
gather as many ace hunters here
to this stratum as possible?

271
00:13:57,040 --> 00:14:00,997
If you're right about that
then we really fell for it.

272
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:07,880
Anyway that's as far as i've
gotten with that theory though.

273
00:14:08,420 --> 00:14:10,877
I know the worst case
scenario but i don't know

274
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:13,607
for sure so it's best
not to cause any alarm.

275
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:16,016
You're the only one I can tell, Boxo.

276
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:16,950
Hello there!

277
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:18,870
Huh?

278
00:14:18,953 --> 00:14:19,783
Oh, thank you.

279
00:14:20,100 --> 00:14:21,218
Don't mind if I do.

280
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:23,080
That's right.

281
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:25,419
Have a milk tea about it and relax.

282
00:14:25,700 --> 00:14:26,880
We'll figure it out.

283
00:14:28,220 --> 00:14:30,880
The flow of magic power seems odd.

284
00:14:31,220 --> 00:14:33,867
It's increasing and
growing rather unsettled.

285
00:14:34,020 --> 00:14:36,902
I have a feeling this
could spell trouble for us.

286
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:39,002
Turns out the old guy was right.

287
00:14:39,100 --> 00:14:40,797
Not long after that conversation,

288
00:14:40,880 --> 00:14:44,645
We discovered that another hunter
team had found the Netherlord.

289
00:15:03,980 --> 00:15:04,880
Take this!

290
00:15:14,620 --> 00:15:15,450
Good.

291
00:15:15,533 --> 00:15:17,086
We're in position behind him.

292
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:20,077
Hoxie and Shimelai will
provide covering fire.

293
00:15:20,160 --> 00:15:21,180
You bet we will.

294
00:15:21,500 --> 00:15:24,029
Karyos and Gorth, you
two will stand guard.

295
00:15:24,220 --> 00:15:25,514
Sign your orders, sir.

296
00:15:25,820 --> 00:15:29,280
Lamas, we have tons of aces
out here. Don't go nuts.

297
00:15:29,780 --> 00:15:31,080
I'll do my best.

298
00:15:31,220 --> 00:15:32,280
Help us out, Boxo.

299
00:15:32,880 --> 00:15:33,710
Hello there.

300
00:15:34,480 --> 00:15:36,217
Everyone else will charge him.

301
00:15:36,300 --> 00:15:39,917
While our goal is ultimately to slay the
Netherlord, do not do anything reckless.

302
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:42,557
We can buy time until
reinforcements arrive.

303
00:15:42,640 --> 00:15:43,540
Kill me, sir.

304
00:15:43,980 --> 00:15:46,862
Let's show them what the
dungeon's finest can do!

305
00:15:58,720 --> 00:16:00,120
Hmph!

306
00:16:08,480 --> 00:16:09,920
Form change!

307
00:16:10,660 --> 00:16:12,600
Power lesser!

308
00:16:13,380 --> 00:16:14,837
And with telekinesis,

309
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:17,937
the new blessing I acquired in that
last battle I've been training every

310
00:16:18,020 --> 00:16:21,117
night to build up my physical strength
and dexterity let's see what I

311
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:26,217
can do with it now how do you monsters
feel about this huh I'm not technically

312
00:16:26,300 --> 00:16:32,020
a vending machine anymore but what
else is new that was amazing boxo

313
00:16:50,460 --> 00:16:54,157
Looks like we're just spinning our
wheels until we defeat the Netherlord.

314
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,220
Yes, indeed.

315
00:16:55,560 --> 00:16:58,619
It seems he's using some
sort of regeneration spell.

316
00:17:02,540 --> 00:17:04,637
Everyone, get away from there at once!

317
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:08,437
The Netherlord is gathering a vast
amount of magic power to himself.

318
00:17:08,520 --> 00:17:11,517
I suspect it's some kind
of massive explosion spell.

319
00:17:11,600 --> 00:17:12,657
Let's split right!

320
00:17:12,740 --> 00:17:15,077
But what about the other team of hunters?

321
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:16,513
I'll take care of them.

322
00:17:17,620 --> 00:17:19,860
I suggest you all cover your ears.

323
00:17:20,220 --> 00:17:21,940
But I don't have hands!

324
00:17:22,120 --> 00:17:23,040
Or ears.

325
00:17:23,300 --> 00:17:25,380
Or eardrums, for that matter.

326
00:17:25,660 --> 00:17:27,180
Major spell incoming!

327
00:17:27,580 --> 00:17:28,440
Fall back!

328
00:17:29,600 --> 00:17:31,580
Now why would they do that?

329
00:17:31,860 --> 00:17:33,160
And was it in time?

330
00:17:39,020 --> 00:17:40,079
Deploying barrier!

331
00:17:57,940 --> 00:17:59,460
Well, well, well.

332
00:17:59,840 --> 00:18:01,680
Not a single death, eh?

333
00:18:02,140 --> 00:18:04,700
Elite hunters are not to be trifled with.

334
00:18:05,220 --> 00:18:07,920
All my monsters perish, but so what?

335
00:18:08,060 --> 00:18:09,700
I can always make all.

336
00:18:10,260 --> 00:18:12,613
There's no way to beat him at this rate.

337
00:18:12,740 --> 00:18:15,697
Only one of us has the power
to turn the tide of battle.

338
00:18:15,780 --> 00:18:16,900
And that's me.

339
00:18:18,900 --> 00:18:22,360
Ah, the blessing of my
girl and her magic item.

340
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:26,580
I'll be your worthy adversary
if you can reach me.

341
00:18:27,380 --> 00:18:28,210
Okay.

342
00:18:28,293 --> 00:18:29,280
It's now or never.

343
00:18:30,460 --> 00:18:31,813
That's not the real me.

344
00:18:32,100 --> 00:18:33,865
I'm far above the battlefield.

345
00:18:34,260 --> 00:18:38,319
Lamas flung me up here during the
mayhem of that big explosion spell.

346
00:18:38,500 --> 00:18:41,377
She's carrying a decoy,
a magic item Hulemy made.

347
00:18:41,460 --> 00:18:43,080
The housing-only me.

348
00:18:43,420 --> 00:18:44,832
The real me transformed.

349
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:49,477
Manipulated balloons using telekinesis and
is directly above the Netherlord's head.

350
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:50,977
Here goes...

351
00:18:51,060 --> 00:18:52,020
Form change!

352
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:58,897
Japan's largest vending machine, which
can be found in a certain fishing harbor.

353
00:18:58,980 --> 00:19:02,037
It's over 18 meters tall and
has even been featured on TV!

354
00:19:02,120 --> 00:19:02,950
Here it is!

355
00:19:03,033 --> 00:19:04,880
The Giant Ice Vending Machine!

356
00:19:05,720 --> 00:19:07,480
Find all you want, hunters.

357
00:19:07,780 --> 00:19:10,780
We shall see if you have
what it takes to reach me.

358
00:19:11,360 --> 00:19:12,190
Me?

359
00:19:12,273 --> 00:19:13,300
What is that?

360
00:19:13,680 --> 00:19:15,960
A vending machine, punk! What else?

361
00:19:25,040 --> 00:19:28,334
I came prepared in case I
couldn't crush you right away!

362
00:19:36,080 --> 00:19:37,962
Before I took on this huge body,

363
00:19:38,080 --> 00:19:42,668
I switched back to the regular vending
machine and got my secret weapon ready!

364
00:19:43,140 --> 00:19:44,617
Because I increased my physical strength,

365
00:19:44,700 --> 00:19:47,357
my maximum electroshock
is now off the charts!

366
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:48,720
Eat, Fools!

367
00:19:58,080 --> 00:19:58,910
Ah! Ah!

368
00:20:07,520 --> 00:20:08,350
Boxxo!

369
00:20:08,520 --> 00:20:09,480
Are you okay?

370
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:11,280
Are you hurt?

371
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:12,577
No damage anywhere?

372
00:20:12,660 --> 00:20:13,490
I'm fine, Lamas.

373
00:20:13,573 --> 00:20:14,403
As you can see.

374
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:20,820
Heads up!

375
00:20:20,980 --> 00:20:22,000
He's still alive!

376
00:20:24,620 --> 00:20:26,757
This staff is precious, you see!

377
00:20:26,840 --> 00:20:28,340
I cannot lose it.

378
00:20:29,520 --> 00:20:32,402
Nevertheless, you managed
to defeat a part of me,

379
00:20:32,540 --> 00:20:35,011
but it was merely my left arm transformed?

380
00:20:35,340 --> 00:20:37,640
though that is worthy of praise indeed.

381
00:20:38,500 --> 00:20:39,820
His left arm?

382
00:20:39,940 --> 00:20:40,822
Is this a joke?

383
00:20:41,180 --> 00:20:46,220
You may have defeated my appendage, but
I did still accomplish my original goal.

384
00:20:46,980 --> 00:20:48,660
What was his original goal?

385
00:20:50,160 --> 00:20:54,100
That was to gather all the capable
hunters here in one place. Shh!

386
00:20:54,480 --> 00:20:56,200
Hume's hunch was right on.

387
00:20:56,920 --> 00:21:01,120
You see, whenever hunters or
monsters perish within this dungeon,

388
00:21:01,420 --> 00:21:03,437
the dungeon itself accumulates power.

389
00:21:03,520 --> 00:21:05,932
in direct proportion to that of the dead.

390
00:21:06,760 --> 00:21:11,080
Then I can employ said power
to produce more new monsters.

391
00:21:11,620 --> 00:21:13,880
That is the way this dungeon operates.

392
00:21:14,680 --> 00:21:15,510
Interesting.

393
00:21:16,020 --> 00:21:18,757
Seems kind of similar to
the way I run on points.

394
00:21:18,840 --> 00:21:22,217
From that knowledge, a brilliant
plan fomented in my mind.

395
00:21:22,300 --> 00:21:24,317
I would kill everything
in this dungeon and

396
00:21:24,400 --> 00:21:27,157
use the power to produce
a new pack of monsters.

397
00:21:27,240 --> 00:21:32,181
Now then, perhaps the more astute among you
have already figured out what I'm doing.

398
00:21:32,780 --> 00:21:33,860
I knew it.

399
00:21:34,040 --> 00:21:37,517
If all the aces are gathered in
this place, then that means...

400
00:21:37,600 --> 00:21:40,317
The other strata's defenses
are stretched thin.

401
00:21:40,400 --> 00:21:41,812
If they were attacked...

402
00:21:41,900 --> 00:21:43,300
It'd be real bad!

403
00:21:43,580 --> 00:21:48,737
Now, given the current situation, don't
you think it'd be wise to hurry back?

404
00:21:48,820 --> 00:21:51,100
You may transfer to other strata,

405
00:21:51,260 --> 00:21:54,297
but I'll see to it that you
cannot leave the dungeon.

406
00:21:54,380 --> 00:21:56,600
And so round two begins.

407
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:58,817
Struggle against me with all your might.

408
00:21:58,900 --> 00:22:00,360
You will not thwart me.

409
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:03,540
Give your lives and
your power to my cause.

410
00:22:22,760 --> 00:22:24,160
Oh

411
00:23:34,860 --> 00:23:36,740
You could even win a reward.

412
00:23:37,820 --> 00:23:39,938
I look forward to serving you again.
